00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
Episode 65

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
Chaotix, Electric Shock Love Tactics

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.040
Oh, my mistake.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.910
Sonic.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.250
Catch you later!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.460
We're done.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.380
Hey, Tails.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:01.350
I always wanted to know why you have palm trees on your spaceship.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.850
Why?

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:09.270
Because Chuck told me that I needed palm trees to fly through outer space.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.980
Grandpa said that?

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.070
Hey Amy, take care of this for me.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.410
Sonic!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.030
Do you think Shadow is okay?

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.450
Knowing him, there's nothing to worry about.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.210
Wait, Sonic!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.140
The Master Emerald saved us, Knuckles.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.930
But I'm worried about Rouge.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.480
Stupid bat girl!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.900
Serves her right for being nosy!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.610
Just a little more to go...

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.860
Are you okay?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.950
It was a close call this time.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.870
But more importantly, Tails...

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:12.960
Why were they trying to crystallize the Planet Egg?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.710
Planet Eggs and Chaos Emeralds both have high energy.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.720
I'm sure it has something to do with that.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.260
The Metarex are full of mysteries.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.220
Red Pine said that he was one of the four Metarex bosses.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.980
That means there are three other powerful enemies.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.980
How did they defeat Red Pine?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.690
He's always careful.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.150
You misjudge him.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.200
His endgame was weak.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.530
But then again, he's not like someone I know who solely relies on power.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:47.450
What?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:52.460
That's enough, Pale Bay Leaf and Yellow Zelkova.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.630
I'm getting tired of watching you fight.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:59.670
Black Narcissus, we just have differing opinions.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.550
So be it.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:07.180
But I'm interested in the ones who defeated Red Pine.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.810
This planet was too easy to defeat.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:19.610
Even if I have to wait for Dark Oak's orders, I'll be the one to defeat them.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.780
Farewell.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.650
Everyone is all talk!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.570
Get ready to leave at any time!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.910
The enemy must have taken heavy damage from their battle.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:37.460
I cannot allow them to exist!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.220
An unidentified spaceship is approaching from ahead!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.930
What about the ally ID code?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.810
There's nothing!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.140
Put it on the monitor at maximum zoom!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.140
Roger!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.400
Another enemy?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.980
Chaotix?

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.450
I don't know how, but we were lost in space.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.990
It's embarrassing.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.410
We're not good with machines.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.880
It's been awhile since you brought those presents. Were you lost this entire time?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.460
I guess so.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.960
Please don't tell Cream's mother.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.920
Because she's the one who hired us.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.640
Why didn't you use the ally ID code?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:31.010
Charmy was messing around with the ship's systems.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:31.930
It's not my fault!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:39.650
Until we finish repairing the ship, you'll have to stay on Blue Typhoon.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.900
But don't wander around the ship! This is captain's orders!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.320
Thank you.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:48.910
What? This fox is the captain?

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.410
I'm sorry that I'm not good enough for you!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:56.330
Now now, Charmy's rude because he's still a kid.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:02.340
Oh, since you're repairing the ship anyway, add a multi-functional automatic navigation system!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.960
Please, Captain?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.090
Fine.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.050
I brought food.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.680
Where's Chris?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:18.230
He's inspecting the Blue Typhoon's engines.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.770
I can handle this simple job by myself.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.980
You sure have a lot on your hands.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.110
No, this is easy.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.610
Besides, they were in trouble.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.700
What is it, Vector?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:35.790
I know why he wanted us to stay in our rooms.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.700
What do you mean?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.370
You guys are dense.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:43.340
Tails is in love with that girl.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:46.170
He wanted to create a lovey-dovey mood.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.220
I'm worried because everyone is tired.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.970
But that's when we have to stay strong.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.560
That's why I have an idea.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.100
What are you going to do?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.560
It's a secret.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.440
They're only chatting about regular stuff.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.070
That's why you're amateurs.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:14.240
I'm not only a professional detective, but I'm also an authority on love.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.540
Look at how hard he's trying!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:22.080
When it comes to love, Tails is a late bloomer, so he's beating around the bush.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.790
He's a perfect example of someone who's not popular with girls.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:24.710
Really?

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.170
My judgments are never wrong.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.880
On no! Hide!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:48.820
Poor thing... He couldn't confess his love, so he's trying to forget by focusing on his work.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.740
I understand how he feels!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.580
You must have a painful past, Vector.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.580
He's fixing our ship for us...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.540
It's disgraceful for the Chaotix Detective Agency to freeload.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.460
Therefore, let's take our shirts off our backs for Tails.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.550
We're getting naked?

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.090
Don't be silly, idiot!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.810
We're going to help make their love come true!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.020
It's the "Women Love Strong Men" plan!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.980
First, villains will attack her.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.770
Of course, this is all an act.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:33.990
When the girl is in trouble, who should appear but Tails!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.240
Hey you! Let go of her!

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.490
What did you say, punk?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.420
Tails, you're so manly!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:48.340
It's no big deal.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.260
And they fall in love.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:04.690
First, I'll lure out the girl while Charmy brings Tails.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:07.650
Does that mean I play the villain? I refuse!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.530
They know what we look like, so we can't play the villain.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.690
So here's what we do. Listen!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.490
Who is it?

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.370
Polishing gems is boring.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.120
Play with me instead!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.880
This is my job.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:37.090
Hard-headed Knuckles has to polish hard gems!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.640
So you really want me to play...

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.220
Why you!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.310
Floral!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.280
That went well.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.440
All that's left to do is...

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:58.910
This, this and this!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.030
Espio, it's your turn.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:02.910
Understood.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.080
I wonder what Vector wants.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:10.920
Hey!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.760
Stop, young lady!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.510
This is the first street in hell!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.300
Oops.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:23.760
It's dangerous for a young lady to walk here by herself!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.310
Espio, threaten her!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.730
Okay.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.910
Nice! Go for it, Tails!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.950
What are you doing, Knuckles?

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.280
Cosmo?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:48.290
I don't know. Knuckles suddenly started dancing.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.210
I didn't know Knuckles liked to dance.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.340
Gulp!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.960
But he's dancing.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.710
That's weird.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.680
This is bad! Espio, retreat!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.430
You'll pay for this!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:08.430
I thought Knuckles was uptight, but he's actually pretty unique.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:14.570
We scored some points for Knuckles.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.070
At this rate, she's going to fall in love with Knuckles.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.710
Powerful gravitational forces damaged our bodies.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.510
But it hasn't damaged our teamwork!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:43.220
If I knew this was going to happen, I should've been a blacksmith!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.010
Look at me!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.230
I've grown this tall!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.060
You're just long and narrow!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.980
Stop overlapping with my character design!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.480
We'll fix you right away!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.730
Stop! Don't do this!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.570
I want to stay tall!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:04.200
You're just jealous because I look cool now!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:13.250
I didn't think you would board my ship.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.500
I don't expect to stay for free.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.550
I'll pay you back.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.300
Gee, thanks.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.420
Where are we anyway?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:27.310
We were sucked into a gravitational anomaly and sent to another galaxy.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.020
What do you mean?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.230
In other words, it's a wormhole.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:36.690
The Metarex must have several of them.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.070
I see.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.030
What if he doesn't wake up?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.490
That won't happen. This is Shadow we're talking about.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:49.040
When he changed back from his Super Form, he released all his energy at once.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.910
I hope that hasn't affected him in other ways.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.790
Such as getting his memory back?

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.710
Whoa!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.250
Doctor... Rouge...

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.010
You've regained consciousness, Shadow.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.010
It looks like you're all safe.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.720
Thanks to you.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:12.270
And thanks to those limiters.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.900
I see.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.990
I'm sorry.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.950
Me too. I wasn't watching where I was going.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.540
Are you all right?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.000
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.420
I'm in a rush, so I'll talk to you later.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.340
Huh?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.760
She must've dropped it when I bumped into her.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.390
On with the next plan!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.560
Do you have any good ideas?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.400
I'll start thinking of one now.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.910
Cosmo?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.750
You found out.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.250
So this is what you were talking about.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:28.260
I'm having a surprise party to make everyone feel better.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.550
But doing this all by yourself is too much work.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.350
If it's okay with you, I'd like to help.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.720
But you have to repair the ship.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.640
No problem. I already finished.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:38.520
Let's get started.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:40.980
Thank you so much!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.360
Where should we start?

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.360
Hmm...

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.490
Well done, Tails.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.820
We should now mind our own business.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.660
What are you talking about? The final push is important in love!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:55.750
Tails isn't the type who can do that.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:15:01.540
The love expert Vector will give him the push!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:02.460
Ahem!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.750
Hi, you two!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.170
Vector.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.380
I overheard your conversation.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.760
We'll help too.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.010
Really?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.060
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:17.270
C'mon Captain, don't be like that!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:20.390
Who do you think we're trying to help?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.020
Oops, never mind.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:28.110
Since Tails is a late bloomer, I know he'll be working somewhere away from Cosmo.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.410
That's when I turn off the lights.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:36.410
Then Espio and I will quickly bring the two together.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:43.330
The sudden darkness will cause their hearts to beat rapidly, so their love voltage will rise instantly!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.710
It's the "Surprise Date in the Darkness" plan!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.220
Vector, your laughter is giving me the creeps.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.520
Just as I expected.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.020
Now!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:06.900
Okay!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.830
Are you all right?

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.460
You shouldn't run in the dark.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.790
I'll be more careful next time.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.670
What's the next plan?

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:35.970
I'm currently drawing on my wisdom and experience to envision the best situation.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.390
Isn't it best to leave them alone?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.520
You really don't understand anything.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.100
You'll never fall in love that way-

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.230
What is it?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.480
There's still another way!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:53.200
When Tails gets near Cosmo...

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.280
Invisible Espio drops a handkerchief.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.200
Miss, you dropped your handkerchief.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.500
Oh, that's mine.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.420
Thank you.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.710
You're such a wonderful woman.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.590
Will you have tea with me?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.760
I'm so happy!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.760
They start dating and fall in love!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:26.020
It's the "Random Encounter and Dropped Handkerchief of Love" plan!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.020
Hey, Cosmo.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:32.070
About that decoration over there...

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.400
Go!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:38.620
You dropped something. Is it yours?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.620
No, it's not mine.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:45.250
There's no way you'd have a handkerchief this dirty, Cosmo.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.880
There's a name embroidered on it.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.790
V-e-c-t-o-r.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.840
Vector, you should wash your handkerchief once in a while!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.550
I'm sorry!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.560
Everything you do backfires!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.850
I had no idea that Tails was so dense.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.980
I don't think that's the issue.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.980
We're almost done.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.490
You were a great help, Tails. Thank you.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:18.990
We're friends. You can always ask for my help.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.990
Friends...

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:27.080
You're right! Everyone is a dear friend!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.580
Yeah!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:34.840
Do you know the proverb, "Those who try to thwart love will be kicked by a horse?"

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.890
Let's get everything ready for the party!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.850
Get ready? But they're almost finished.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.760
Don't worry about that.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:46.890
If you sweat the small stuff, girls won't like you!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:51.860
Watch out!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.620
Are you okay, Cosmo?

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.990
Thank you very much.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.410
I'm sorry!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.540
It's fine. Umm...

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.300
What are you looking at!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.210
Excuse us!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:26.220
You can hang it.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.640
Yes!

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.730
You're very kind, Tails.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.690
Cosmo...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.650
What is it?

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:36.650
You're light...

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:39.860
He's doing well.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.610
Switch on!

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.450
It's beautiful!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.370
We have to figure out how to bring everyone here.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.960
How should we do it?

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:57.090
Leave it to the Chaotix Detective Agency!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:01.880
So how should we do it?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.220
You don't plan anything, do you.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.890
They're the only ones who would do this!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.310
How dare you do this to my face!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.320
I'll punish you with my Shovel Claws!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.360
Wait! You'll understand if we talk.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.320
No I won't!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.740
Run!

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:22.700
Stop!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.030
I'm scared!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.660
No mercy!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.800
What are you guys doing?

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:49.520
Cosmo was putting together a surprise party to cheer us up.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.390
But now...

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.350
Sorry.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.020
Is the party canceled?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.440
Of course not!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.940
Even though it's messy, a party is a party.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.780
Everybody, let's have fun!

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.990
Sonic!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.530
Thank you, Cosmo!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.120
This is bad! The star of the show stole her heart.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.380
Look, Sonic!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.510
I'm all dressed up!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.590
Amy, you're beautiful!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:30.060
It represents a petal fluttering in the wind.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.520
I'm definitely the princess of the party.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.100
And Sonic's heart is mine.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:42.490
So who was the criminal in the case? It was the mysterious Ochaman!

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.580
Cosmo.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.580
Tails!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.790
We had a lot of trouble, but it was fun.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.710
Thanks to you, Tails.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.170
Oh yeah! Here!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:07.180
I forgot to return it to you. I refurbished it.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.510
Do you like it?

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.720
Thank you!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.810
I'll treasure it!

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:15.310
I'm glad you like it!

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.110
Beautiful... Cosmo...

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.030
Yes, the stars are beautiful.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:30.410
I wish I could stare at these beautiful stars forever.

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.410
Yeah.

